        ("How do window functions behave in Spark?", "Like SQL windows. The order and the frame still decide whether you see the future. Spark does not make a bad window point-in-time.", "A window with no order, assumed to be safe."),
        ("What is a narrow versus a wide transformation?", "Narrow stays in the partition, like a filter. Wide needs a shuffle, like a groupby. I look for the wide ones when a job is slow.", "Optimizing a filter that was never the cost."),
